The Crystal Globe is a casino in the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Masque District/index|Masque District]]. The Party holds a card for the Globe from Cosimo, a member of the [[Org/Velvet Mark/index|Velvet Mark]], who told them to mention that he had sent them.
